1
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:29,450
(Howard:)So, my dear, we meet again.

2
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:33,160
(Katee Sackhoff:)Hello, Howard.

3
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,530
(Katee Sackhoff:)I've missed you.

4
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:38,430
(Katee Sackhoff:)I've missed you,
Katee Sackhoff.

5
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:40,730
(Katee Sackhoff:)One question.
Anything.

6
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:44,240
Why am I wearing my
Battlestar Galactica
flight suit in bed?

7
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:47,370
Why are you in bed with me?

8
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:51,180
(Howard:)If we start to question this,
it all falls apart.

9
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,340
(Katee Sackhoff:)Sorry.

10
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:55,580
(Katee Sackhoff:)Oh, ravish
me, Howard.

11
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,820
(Katee Sackhoff:)My loins
ache for you.

12
00:00:58,850 --> 00:01:02,020
(Howard:)Okay, if you insist.

